# ESP32 Custom Onewheel — Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env and fill in values as needed.

# Currently this is a client-side-only PWA — BLE communication
# happens directly between the browser and ESP32, no server needed.
# Future additions might include:
#   VITE_API_URL=https://api.example.com
#   VITE_ANALYTICS_ID=UA-XXXXXXXXX
